WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
Readiness needs executable proof.

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:06.920
Can the team start a pinned build
and restore the same synthetic balances?

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:12.000
Can it replay a timeout and duplicate
callback through an owned provider model?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:16.080
Can it read committed journal facts
without depending on an AI summary?

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.960
Can another engineer reproduce the result?

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:24.280
Unknown or failed prerequisites
block the dependent execution scope.

00:00:24.338 --> 00:00:26.560
Reviewed drafting can have
a narrower starting

00:00:26.607 --> 00:00:29.040
requirement than automated execution.
